@startuml epic-c-command-event
!theme plain
title Epic C: 訓練建立與 AI 系統控制 - Command-Event 對應

left to right direction

package "Training Commands" {
  usecase "CreateTraining\n建立訓練" as C1
  usecase "DeleteTraining\n刪除訓練" as C2
}

package "AI Commands" {
  usecase "StartAISystem\n啟動 AI 系統" as C3
  usecase "StopAISystem\n關閉 AI 系統" as C4
}

package "Training Events" {
  usecase "TrainingCreated\n訓練已建立" as E1
  usecase "TrainingDeleted\n訓練已刪除" as E2
}

package "AI Events" {
  usecase "AISystemStarted\nAI 系統已啟動" as E3
  usecase "AISystemStopped\nAI 系統已關閉" as E4
}

C1 --> E1
C2 --> E2
C3 --> E3
C4 --> E4

note bottom of E2
  **硬刪除**:
  刪除訓練時一併刪除
  所有投球資料
end note

note bottom of E3
  **前置條件**:
  AI 系統未運作中
end note

@enduml
